This Pokémon has become attached to me.{VAR BE01}
But as far as I'm concerned, a Pokémon
is just a simple tool.{VAR BE01}
I don't understand...

Poké Balls...{VAR BE01}
From my point of view, they are items
that keep Pokémon confined.{VAR BE01}
But for Trainers like you, they are a way
to bond with Pokémon...{VAR BE01}
If you run out of Poké Balls,
come see me. I will give one to you.
